            },
            "description": "Retrieve a user list upload job, including its current status and progress. Poll this endpoint until the job reaches a terminal state.\n\nRequires the promotions job ID from Create User List Upload Job (or set `promotions_job_id` manually in the environment).\n\n```\nGET /pss/v1/fis/{{institution_id}}/audiences/userListJobs/{{promotions_job_id}}\n```"
