      ],
      "description": "## 🔄 Get User List Upload Job Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2 | Create User List Upload Job | (Optional) If a promotions job ID is unavailable, create a user list upload job with name, users, and an optional custom description. Otherwise, proceed using the existing promotions job ID. |\n| 3 | Get User List Upload Job | Retrieve a user list upload job, including its current status and progress, using the promotions job ID. Poll this endpoint until the job reaches a terminal state. |"
